    "html": "\n        <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n          <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"4\">Level 4 - Advanced</span>\n          <span class=\"time\">35 min</span>\n          <span class=\"chip company\">Google</span><span class=\"chip company\">Amazon</span><span class=\"chip company\">Microsoft</span><span class=\"chip company\">Meta</span>\n        </div>\n        <h1>Design a Load Balancer (L4/L7)</h1>\n        <p class=\"lead\">Design the thing that sits in front of every big service: one IP address that millions of clients hit, spread over hundreds of servers, that keeps TCP connections alive while machines come and go. This is the HLD question where a networking background is a superpower.</p>\n      "
